        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "EU Transfer of Funds regulation and Tether liquidity concerns signal that unaudited fundraising vehicles and stablecoin-denominated raise structures face escalating compliance scrutiny across major jurisdictions.",
